        "id": 1869395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-17T22:45:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The case I was locking for is copying coherent data out of thread-\u003eee at the same time a third-party thread is writing an error to it. This is possible as long as no read buffer is passed during a call and also the extended error is pulled without getting a return error message first. So this is obviously not something that libbinder does and not worth locking for in reality.",
      "parentUuid": "9fd29a1d_d02f7a1f",
